<title>HONG KONG: Shangri-La gearing to rise in 1997.</title>
<headline>Shangri-La gearing to rise in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shangri-La Asia Ltd's gearing ratio is expected to rise to 35 percent by end-1997, managing director Paul Bush said on Friday.</p>
<p>Bush was speaking after the hotel company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>At the meeting,  Shangri-La chairman Liu Tai-fung had said that the company's net debt-to-equity ratio was 24 percent at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371  http://www.hk97.com</p>
